cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: RNA-seq Reference Index
abstract: Builds a salmon index (optionally with the genome as decoys), a transcript-to-gene table and a gene
  table from a transcriptome FASTA, genome FASTA and GTF, once per genome, for the bulk RNA-seq workflows.
